    youtube-music -->|"プレイヤー API のイベントとストアの変化"| ytm-view
    ytm-view -->|"PlayerState API に MessagePort で送る"| protected-api
    protected-api -->|"updateVideoProgress などを emit"| player-state-store
    player-state-store -->|"state-changed などのイベント"| state-consumers
    player-state-store -->|"playerStateStore:stateChanged を送る"| app-screens
    settings-window -->|"store-ipc で configStore:set"| config-store
    config-store -->|"onDidChange / onDidAnyChange"| config-listeners
    config-store -->|"configStore:stateChanged を全ウィンドウへ"| app-screens
    config-listeners -->|"insertCSS で色の変数を入れる"| app-screens
    config-listeners -->|"insertCSS・ズーム・背景動画の状態"| ytm-view
    config-listeners -->|"Integration を有効化・無効化・再起動"| state-consumers
    command-sources -->|"RemoteControl API に execute を送る"| protected-api
    protected-api -->|"RemoteControl の MessagePort で渡す"| ytm-view
    ytm-view -->|"playerApi とストアを直接操作"| youtube-music

